{"displayStem":"두 검체에서 생존 단일 CD19(+) B세포를 먼저 선택하고 같은 설정으로 IgD와 CD27을 측정하였다. 각 패널은 정확히 500개 세포 사건이다. 점선은 보상·음성 대조로 정한 양성 경계이다. 실제 유세포분석 이미지가 아니라 사건 좌표로 작성한 모의 산점도이다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"자료는 독립적으로 작성한 교육용 모의자료이다."}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence \"><div class=\"evidence\"><div class=\"measurement-panels\"><figure class=\"measurement-panel\"><figcaption>조건 Ⅰ</figcaption><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 580 355\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"조건 Ⅰ。IgD 형광 (log₁₀ 상대단위)、CD27 형광 (log₁₀ 상대단위)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"580\" height=\"355\" fill=\"white\"></rect><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"526\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"20\" y=\"25\">CD27 형광 (log₁₀ 상대단위)</text><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"76\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><line x1=\"164\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"164\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"164\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><line x1=\"252\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"252\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"252\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><line x1=\"340\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"340\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><line x1=\"428\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"428\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"428\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><line x1=\"516\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"516\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"516\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"234\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"194.2\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"194.2\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"199.2\" text-anchor=\"end\">1</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"159.39999999999998\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"159.39999999999998\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"164.39999999999998\" tex